abstract: |
  Harvest a CHANGELOG from a repository's Git history:  structured commit
  subjects become RON fragments, then a second pass assembles them into a RON
  CHANGELOG with a rendered Keep a Changelog Markdown sibling.
authors:
  - alias: kevinmatthes
    family-names: Matthes
    given-names: Kevin
cff-version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
keywords:
  - Rust
  - changelog
  - git
  - keep-a-changelog
  - release
  - ron
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
message: Please cite this software using these information.
repository-code: https://github.com/kevinmatthes/git-harvest
title: git-harvest
url: https://github.com/kevinmatthes/git-harvest
version: 0.2.0

